<title>USA: Streamlogic names Preletz chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Streamlogic names Preletz chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp on Wednesday said that Michael O. Preletz has been appointed chairman, chief executive officer and president.</p>
<p>Preletz is a former chairman and CEO of Read-Rite Corp and ADAC Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>Preletz succeeds J. Larry Smart, who resigned from the company and its board to become chairman of Visioneer Inc last month.</p>
